                </div>
                <p class="b-src">Source: brand stores and retailer listings, 11 to 13 Oct 2026; launch prices via the Wayback Machine. Everyday brands: Minimalist, Plum, Dot &amp; Key, The Derma Co and Hyphen for skincare; Lakmé, Maybelline, Sugar, Swiss Beauty and Nykaa for makeup; TRESemmé, Pantene, Plum, Love Beauty and Planet and OGX for haircare. Kay’s Matte Lipstick alone costs 1.3x Lakmé and 0.6x Sugar per gram.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-slide" data-title="The name" hidden>
                @Html.Raw(bsig)
                <p class="b-kick">structure 04, the name</p>
                <h4 class="b-h">A name you can say <em>is a name you can search.</em></h4>
                <div class="b-rule"></div>
                <div class="b-three b-names" role="img" aria-label="Google search interest in India, yearly average 2019 to 2026 on one scale. Kay Beauty rises every year to 11.4. Anomaly stays near 1. 82°E peaks at 1.9 in 2023 and falls to 0.">
                    @foreach (var (word, cls, verdict, why, vals) in new[] {
                        ("Kay", "kay", "Easy", "One syllable and her own initial, like Fenty, Rare and Rhode.", tKay),
                        ("Anomaly", "ano", "A real word", "It means something (“all of us are anomalies”), but it is common, and a big New York ad agency has the same name.", tAno),
                        ("82°E", "e82", "Hard", "A number and a degree sign nobody can type. Search “82E” and you get unrelated results.", tE82) })
                    {
                        <div class="b-card b-anim" style="--c:var(--@cls)">
                            <span class="b-word">@word</span>
